      "content": "I'm working on a failure analysis regarding a section of asphalt in Phoenix, AZ, that is exhibiting premature longitudinal cracking. I need a technical summary of the primary failure mechanisms, with a specific focus on the interplay between thermal expansion/contraction cycles, bitumen viscosity at application temperatures, and how subgrade compaction affects the distribution of these thermal stresses. Please provide a formal, technical breakdown.",
